  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Card for xP3x\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\n\nxP3x (Crosslingual Public Pool of Prompts eXtended) is a collection of prompts & datasets across 277 languages & 16 NLP tasks. It contains all of xP3 + much more! It is used for training future contenders of mT0 & BLOOMZ at project Aya @Cohere Labs 🧡\n\n\nCreation: The dataset can be recreated using instructions available here together with the file in this repository named xp3x_create.py. We provide this version to save processing… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/CohereLabs/xP3x.",
